    }
  ],
  "grouping": [],
  "ordering": [
    {
      "expression": "customers.name",
      "direction": "ascending"
    }
  ],
  "selected_role_check": "NEGATION_NULLS: The exclusion applies to customers and their purchases relationship via purchases.customer_id. Because purchases.customer_id is nullable, NULL purchase customer_id values cannot match customers.customer_id and are ignored for the anti-join; a customer is included only if no purchases row has a non-NULL customer_id equal to that customer's customer_id. No symmetry or reciprocity is assumed."
}

